<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-1074] Remove JMX Bean </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-1074</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;JMX Bean was the old fashion used for exporting metrics. It was introduced before stats-provider introduced. Now stats-provider is there. Let&apos;s remove JMX Bean.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It is the change ported from Twitter branch.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
